          "date": "2026-11-01"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Upstream read each layer's name from Leaflet's MapLayer (layer._layer.getName()); the spec reads it where a user meets it, the layer's group in the layer control (getByRole('group', {name}) within layer-control, named via aria-labelledby as in MapML.js), alongside the public label property. Sleeps replaced by waiting for the fixture's labels. OSMTILE only, as upstream: the layers' content is OSMTILE and naming is projection-independent. Absorbs MapML-OpenLayers test/domApi-HTMLLayerElement.test.js (its 'rejected labels never appear' check is the spec's second test). MapML-MapLibre had no label setter (assigning one threw), now added. Not asserted: MapML-OpenLayers and MapML-MapLibre wrap the layer list in an unnamed <fieldset> (an extra unnamed group); MapML.js uses a <div>.",
      "supersedes": {
        "MapML-OpenLayers": [
          "test/domApi-HTMLLayerElement.test.js"
        ]
      }
    },
